The recent paros definitely flavor this. It's not all hearts and flowers between us; there's always a power play. She's pushing me around, but I enjoy it, mostly. And she's good at it. So, I have to be careful here. Gotta acknowledge the awkwardness without dwelling on it. And lean into the gift thing. Playful is the way to go.

